  2201                          ; CAMEL80D.AZM: CPU and Model Dependencies
  2202                          ;   Source code is for the Z80MR macro assembler.
  2203                          ;   Forth words are documented as follows:
  2204                          ;*   NAME     stack -- stack    description
  2205                          ;   Word names in upper case are from the ANS
  2206                          ;   Forth Core word set.  Names in lower case are
  2207                          ;   "internal" implementation words & extensions.
  2208                          ;
  2209                          ; Direct-Threaded Forth model for Zilog Z80
  2210                          ;   cell size is   16 bits (2 bytes)
  2211                          ;   char size is    8 bits (1 byte)
  2212                          ;   address unit is 8 bits (1 byte), i.e.,
  2213                          ;       addresses are byte-aligned.
  2214                          ; ===============================================
  2215                          
